{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Corrupted Basement is an atmospheric survival horror game where you're trapped in a series of dark and unfamiliar basements. Your only goal: escape. Each basement presents a different challenge, demanding a unique way to open the exit \u2014 all while having to stay one step ahead of a relentless presence that stalks the halls alongside its corrupted creations.  <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/ad628aadcfdf4290f9fb2b1006b0eca5.avif?t=1753809217\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/6004d819c80e1a83528e348bb936cd9e.poster.avif?t=1753809217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/6004d819c80e1a83528e348bb936cd9e.webm?t=1753809217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/6004d819c80e1a83528e348bb936cd9e.mp4?t=1753809217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If it finds you, the chase begins. Escape before it turns you into one of its creations.<i> </i><br><br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/780a0f5989cace5963ebe51911b850b0.avif?t=1753809217\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/f7a78d0c1b69ed51ef26041a22b8eefe.poster.avif?t=1753809217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/f7a78d0c1b69ed51ef26041a22b8eefe.webm?t=1753809217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/f7a78d0c1b69ed51ef26041a22b8eefe.mp4?t=1753809217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>Find a way to open the exits and escape the basements. Each basement may require its own unique solution.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br>   <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/e6619187694c3605bb4281fe24636b5c.avif?t=1753809217\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/4c4a9018bcbe24e8986c219dc3442aea.poster.avif?t=1753809217\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/extras/4c4a9018bcbe24e8986c219dc3442aea.webm?t=1753809217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> It's accompanied by its corrupted creations, which are ready to sabotage you.<br><br><br><br> <i>This game is in active development \u2014 gameplay will continue to expand and evolve until release.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3880060?t=1753809217","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/a67f66aa3e538611237b3b665f1612430fe6cb45/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753809217","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/84301ff40b295db55ef7582ecee4e231ff235b9a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753809217","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3880060/84301ff40b295db55ef7582ecee4e231ff235b9a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753809217","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],